/**
 * ─── DEMO DATASET ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * Constant demo data for every interface of the app, written as the database
 * rows the loaders read (snake_case), so the demo exercises the exact same code
 * paths as production.
 *
 * The numbers are generated by a seeded pseudo-random walk, so they are the SAME
 * on every load, and they hang together: pistolet indexes follow one another from
 * brigade to brigade, cuves are refilled by fuel purchases when they run low,
 * brigade takings are split between cash, client bons and TPE, and every part's
 * sales, purchases, expenses and salaries feed its own caisse. Dates are anchored
 * on "today" so the current month is always full of activity.
 * ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 */
